STATEMENT: >>>
The operator's direction that annotations -- gaps, review comments, open
questions, conflicts, things to be addressed -- belong to the WORK family
rather than a family of their own. The exact node types this yields still
need design. This reframes WORK-ANNOTATION-NODES, which is parked, and bears
on WORK-GRAMMAR-FILE-SPLIT's proposed annotations file.
